 "text": "Badger State Ethanol – Produces over 50 million gallons of ethanol a year from Monroe, Wisconsin facility. Company overview and biofuel news.\nAbout\nHistory\nOfficers & Directors\nA Tribute to John\nGiving Back to the Community\nNews\nInvestors\nInvestor Registration\nInvesting through FNC\nDirect Unit Trading\nForms\nInvestor Information 🔒\nInvestor Survey 2021\nSmart Stations\nProducts\nEthanol\nCarbon Dioxide\nCo-Products\nContact\nCareers\nDELIVERIES\nLOGIN\nCUSTOMER PORTAL\nSearch for:\nSmart Stations\nSmart fuel for a smart future.\nFind a station\nHow we started our journey\nThe unique history of Badger State Ethanol and the passion we share for renewable fuel.\nOur History\nOur Products\nFrom renewable ethanol fuel to grain co-products like protein feed\nOur Products\nGiving Back to the Community\nOrganizations We Support\nprev\nnext\nSmart Stations\nPlatteville has upgraded to the newer Flex-fuel pumps.\nLearn More\nOur Products\nEverything in a kernel of corn is utilized - Zero waste!\nProducts\nIndustry News\nResources and links to the latest industry news.\nLinks\nFollow Along\nFor up to date happenings in the industry and at our plant.\nFacebook Page\nRecent Industry News\nKeeping you updated on what’s happening in the ethanol world.\nEPA Announces Members to the Farm, Ranch, and Rural Communities Advisory Committee\nEPA Announces Members to the Farm, Ranch and Rural Communities Advisory Committee | US EPA\nRead More\n12/11/2024\nNews\nFor Investors:\nInvesting through FNC\nDirect Unit Trading\nFNC BADG page\nForms\nInvestor Information\nInvestor Survey 2021\nBadger State Ethanol are proud members of\nRecent Posts:\nEPA Announces Members to the Farm, Ranch, and Rural Communities Advisory Committee\nBenefits of Ethanol\nBadger State Ethanol Surpasses 1 Billion Gallons of Production\nPages:\nHome\nAbout Us\nInvestor Registration\nSmart Stations\nProducts\nContact\n© Badger State Ethanol , 2020.",
